@startuml
[*] --> Registration
Registration --> SignedIn : registration successful
Registration --> AccessDenied : registration failed
SignedIn --> AccessGranted : signed in
AccessGranted --> NewsAndContent : access granted
AccessGranted --> HealthInfo : access granted
AccessGranted --> PaymentProcessing : payment required
AccessGranted --> FeedbackCollection : service completion
AccessDenied --> [*]
NewsAndContent --> AccessGranted : continue using
HealthInfo --> AccessGranted : continue using
PaymentProcessing --> InsuranceValidation : insurance selected
PaymentProcessing --> CashPaymentInfo : cash selected
InsuranceValidation --> PaymentComplete : insurance payment
CashPaymentInfo --> PaymentComplete : cash payment
PaymentComplete --> AccessGranted : payment complete
FeedbackCollection --> [*] : feedback submitted
@enduml
